    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just doesnt feel like grieving... it feels like im just waiting for something to happen. like im stuck in this weird limbo where i'm still here but i don't belong here. it's like we were two halves of one person and now i'm just a broken piece that doesnt even fit anywhere. i look in the mirror and i dont even see myself anymore. i just see the space where he used to be.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
